Title: My Vim Configuration
Author: Rich Cheng

@ This is my annotated Vim configuration. And when I say it is my config, I
mean it IS my config.

It's written in the Literate Programming system,
//Inweb -> https://ganelson.github.io/inweb/// and so it's compiled into both
my actual |.vim| directory that Vim reads, and also into a human-readable
version. viz. this website.
